 "remarks": "** 5 month Rowayton winter rental Feb 1 - June 30 2027** Will consider shorter term 30 minimum but not for June only. 4 Bedroom 3.5 Bath home custom built in 2012.  Fenced in property with private yard, just 2 blocks to downtown Rowayton and Pinkney Park.  Light and bright with windows and glass galore. Open floor plan encompasses a gorgeous white kitchen with white quartzite counters and island with hints of blue waves, farm style dining table, and Family room with gas fireplace and TV. Separate cozy den with TV.  Guest Bedroom on the first floor with full bath, mudroom, and 1/2 bath. 2nd floor has the large sunny Master BR with balcony, Master Bath with separate double sinks and oversized shower. Another Bedroom and full bath. And laundry room. (4th BR is currently set up as an office, but can make it a BR) use of one side of 2 car garage. A bright sunny house in an ideal location",
